[Submission_1.Description]
La granja ocupada por el enemigo.
[NewSubmission.Success]
[NewSubmission.Failed]
[Submission_2.Objectives]
Libere la aldea de Cuverville.
[Submission_2.Description]
El enemigo se ha consolidado y ha adoptado una posición defensiva en Cuverville.
[NewSubmission1.Success]
[NewSubmission1.Failed]
[Submission_3.Objectives]
Asegure la carretera que conduce al sur.
[Submission_3.Description]
Asegure la carretera y elimine a todos los hostiles de la zona.
[NewSubmission2.Success]
[NewSubmission2.Failed]
[Submission_4.Objectives]
Asegure la carretera al sureste de Cuverville.
[Submission_4.Description]
Despeje de enemigos la carretera y la zona circundante.
